12.75.10.9 emacsvox-eww-marks-mode
..................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-eww-marks-mode

     A light-weight mode for the ‘*Emacsvox EWW Marks Browser*’.
      1. Enables org integration via command
      ‘org-store-link’ bound to M-x org-store-link.
      2. Stored links can be inserted into org files in the same directory
     via command ‘org-insert-link’ bound to M-x org-insert-link.

     In addition to any hooks its parent mode ‘special-mode’ might have
     run, this mode runs the hook ‘emacsvox-eww-marks-mode-hook’, as the
     final or penultimate step during initialization.

12.75.10.10 emacsvox-eww-marks-save
...................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-eww-marks-save

